        <body>
            <div xml:id="d624">

                <pb facs="0732" n="634" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg634"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2678: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Tenney</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-02-24T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 24,
                                1920—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>51. Your February 19, 4 p.m.</p>
                <p>Advise fully if loan by Japanese took the place of proposed joint advance and if
                    so what prevented completion of the latter along the lines agreed upon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
